@host=http://127.0.0.1:8080/scim/v2
@token=entra-secret-token-example

### 1. Pre-create lookup by userName (case-insensitive)
GET {{host}}/Users?filter=userName%20eq%20%22ADELEV@CONTOSO.ONMICROSOFT.COM%22 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### 2. Provision manager user
POST {{host}}/Users HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:User"],
  "externalId": "7c942a21-5f49-4158-9146-c507619a5552",
  "userName": "MeganB@contoso.onmicrosoft.com",
  "displayName": "Megan Bowen",
  "active": true
}

### 3. Provision Microsoft Entra ID gallery user (externalId, addresses.primary, EnterpriseUser)
POST {{host}}/Users HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": [
    "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:User",
    "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User"
  ],
  "externalId": "4f8b9a10-2e3d-4c5b-8a9f-0123456789ab",
  "userName": "AdeleV@contoso.onmicrosoft.com",
  "active": true,
  "displayName": "Adele Vance",
  "title": "Product Marketing Manager",
  "name": {
    "givenName": "Adele",
    "familyName": "Vance",
    "formatted": "Adele Vance"
  },
  "emails": [
    { "value": "adelev@contoso.com", "type": "work", "primary": true }
  ],
  "addresses": [
    {
      "type": "work",
      "streetAddress": "One Microsoft Way",
      "locality": "Redmond",
      "region": "WA",
      "postalCode": "98052",
      "country": "US",
      "primary": true
    }
  ],
  "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User": {
    "employeeNumber": "EMP-10042",
    "department": "Marketing",
    "costCenter": "CC-410"
  }
}

### 4. Lookup by case-exact externalId
GET {{host}}/Users?filter=externalId%20eq%20%224f8b9a10-2e3d-4c5b-8a9f-0123456789ab%22 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### 5. Lookup by colon-delimited EnterpriseUser attribute
GET {{host}}/Users?filter=urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:employeeNumber%20eq%20%22EMP-10042%22 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### 6. Entra multi-op PATCH (value-selection filter, colon-URN keys, stringified boolean)
@userId=REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
@managerId=REPLACE_WITH_MANAGER_ID
PATCH {{host}}/Users/{{userId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:PatchOp"],
  "Operations": [
    {
      "op": "Replace",
      "path": "emails[type eq \"work\"].value",
      "value": "adele.vance@contoso.com"
    },
    {
      "op": "Add",
      "value": {
        "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:department": "Cloud Marketing",
        "urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:extension:enterprise:2.0:User:manager": "{{managerId}}",
        "name.givenName": "Adele Miriam",
        "active": "False"
      }
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Provision Entra security group (?excludedAttributes=members)
POST {{host}}/Groups?excludedAttributes=members HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:Group"],
  "externalId": "grp-9c81ab12-0011-4522-9a10-bb1122334455",
  "displayName": "Contoso-Marketing"
}

### 8. Add members to group
@groupId=REPLACE_WITH_GROUP_ID
PATCH {{host}}/Groups/{{groupId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:PatchOp"],
  "Operations": [
    {
      "op": "Add",
      "path": "members",
      "value": [
        { "value": "{{userId}}" },
        { "value": "{{managerId}}" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 9. Remove a single member (legacy Entra Remove with value array)
PATCH {{host}}/Groups/{{groupId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:PatchOp"],
  "Operations": [
    {
      "op": "Remove",
      "path": "members",
      "value": [
        { "value": "{{userId}}" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 10. Remove a single member (modern ?aadOptscim062020 bracket filter)
PATCH {{host}}/Groups/{{groupId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:PatchOp"],
  "Operations": [
    {
      "op": "Remove",
      "path": "members[value eq \"{{managerId}}\"]"
    }
  ]
}
